* if only Lm2 used: Lm2=5.595e-04 Lm3=5.595e-04 ;no coupling in the positive sequence system (only zero system coupling)
* if Lm3 used: Lm2=5.5023e-4 Lm3=5.779e-4 ;weak coupling in the positive sequence system
+ CL1=2.3356n CL2=0.627n CL3=1.0356n CE=4.57747n
* if only CL2 used: CL2=0.763n CL3=0.763n ;no coupling in the positive sequence system (only zero system coupling)
