***************************************************************************
* another model of a three phase coupled line system with 2 (transposed) lines
* mutual resistance added
* Due to transposing lower amount of parameters used
* 400kV Donaumast 2sys 3x635/117 Stalu 1x234/47 Grounding
* See atp file: Donaumast__2sys_400kV_3x635.acp
* See excel file: ATP_Donaumast_2sys_400kV_2x3x635_117_1x234_47_transposed.xlsx (ATP_overheadline_6Phases_PI)
* NOTE: lm3 is in this model NOT present
* therefore there is only coupling between the zero systems
***************************
* L
* lm1 L
* lm1 lm1 L
* lm2 lm2 lm2 L
* lm2 lm2 lm2 lm1 L
* lm2 lm2 lm2 lm1 lm1 L
***************************
* R
* rm R
* rm rm R
